#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# expand_numerator

#% text
# `expand_numerator(e)` expands the numerators of all fractions in `e`, leaving the denominators alone.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
expand_numerator((x - 1)*((x - 2)/((x - 3)*(x - 4))))
#% output
#= (2 - 3*x + x^2)/((-4 + x)*(-3 + x))

#% cell
expand_numerator(1/(x + 1) + 2/(x + 1)^2 + 3/(x + 1)^3)
#% output
#= 2/(1 + x)^2 + 3/(1 + x)^3 + (1 + x)^-1

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `expand_denominator`, `expand_all`, `expand`
